{
    "_id": "trasatlantico-fizz",
    "name": "Trasatlántico Fizz",
    "instructions": "1. Combine all of the ingredients, except the club soda, in a shaker and shake hard for 10 seconds without ice.\n2. Add ice and shake again for another 10 seconds.\n3. Strain into a glass over ice and top with club soda.\n4. Garnish.",
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "description": "World-renowned bar and Imbibe 75 Place to Watch, Florería Atlántico in Buenos Aires, combines winter citrus in a bright and easy-drinking gin fizz. The cocktail, created in 2013 for the bar's opening menu, \"is a tribute to the immigration that came crossing the Atlantic by boat to the port of Buenos Aires,\" says drink creator Renato Giovannoni.",
    "source": "https://imbibemagazine.com/recipe/trasatlantico-fizz-from-floreria-atlantico/",
    "garnish": "Orange wedge and spritz of peated scotch",
